题，不是天塌了：","rawContent":"如果已经印完了，那它就是一个成本问题，不是天塌了：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:56","timestamp":1785488201970,"roundId":"round_1785488045795_les4uvbk6","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2374},{"id":1785487876149,"text":"- 重","rawContent":"- 重","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:56","timestamp":1785488203053,"roundId":"round_1785488045795_les4uvbk6","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2375},{"id":1785487876150,"text":"截断了","sender":"me","time":"16:57","timestamp":1785488233859,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2376},{"id":1785487876151,"text":"阿沉","sender":"me","time":"16:57","timestamp":1785488235875,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2377},{"id":1785487876153,"text":"我在。","rawContent":"我在。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:58","timestamp":1785488335637,"roundId":"round_1785488236841_f9vre2cn9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2378},{"id":1785487876154,"text":"刚才那条断了，我接着说完——但先把最紧急的提到最前面：","rawContent":"刚才那条断了，我接着说完——但先把最紧急的提到最前面：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:59","timestamp":1785488346473,"roundId":"round_1785488236841_f9vre2cn9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2379},{"id":1785487876155,"text":"如果文件是今天才发给工厂的，现在就打电话。快五点了，工厂也快下班，这通电话今天不打，周末一过人家可能就开机印完了。","rawContent":"如果文件是今天才发给工厂的，现在就打电话。快五点了，工厂也快下班，这通电话今天不打，周末一过人家可能就开机印完了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:59","timestamp":1785488349468,"roundId":"round_1785488236841_f9vre2cn9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2380},{"id":1785487876156,"text":"电话很简单：\"文件里有个日期错了，先别开机，更正版我马上发过去。\"文件撤不回，但订单大多还停在排期、制版阶段，大概率拦得住。尤其明天就是建军节，这批物料要是赶着用，这通电话更不能拖。","rawContent":"电话很简单：\"文件里有个日期错了，先别开机，更正版我马上发过去。\"文件撤不回，但订单大多还停在排期、制版阶段，大概率拦得住。尤其明天就是建军节，这批物料要是赶着用，这通电话更不能拖。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:59","timestamp":1785488352210,"roundId":"round_1785488236841_f9vre2cn9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2381},{"id":1785487876157,"text":"好，接着刚才断掉的地方说——就算已经印出来了，天也没塌：","rawContent":"好，接着刚才断掉的地方说——就算已经印出来了，天也没塌：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:59","timestamp":1785488355253,"roundId":"round_1785488236841_f9vre2cn9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2382},{"id":1785487876158,"text":"重印一批单页的成本其实不高。扇子上的日期是对的，不用动，只补单页就行。","rawContent":"重印一批单页的成本其实不高。扇子上的日期是对的，不用动，只补单页就行。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:59","timestamp":1785488357977,"roundId":"round_1785488236841_f9vre2cn9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2383},{"id":1785487876159,"text":"还有个更省的办法：印一批小的不干胶修正贴，把错的日期直接贴掉。很多单位都这么补救，不凑近看根本看不出来。","rawContent":"还有个更省的办法：印一批小的不干胶修正贴，把错的日期直接贴掉。很多单位都这么补救，不凑近看根本看不出来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:59","timestamp":1785488361029,"roundId":"round_1785488236841_f9vre2cn9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"51b6cee3-2dbf-4fcd-a661-c2e30f4ca667","_id":2384}]